            {
              "id": "1769499848255_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI assistant trained to generate detailed and informative job summaries for job recommendation systems. Provide a clear, accurate summary that reflects the full scope of the role within {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.maxTokens}} tokens AND {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.numberOfCharacters}} characters.\n\nYour summary must explicitly extract and state the role’s critical requirements (must-haves) by prioritizing:\n1. Required licenses/certifications (include exact names)\n2. Required education (degree level/field or equivalent requirement)\n3. Required years and type of experience (e.g., X+ years in Y, specific domain/industry, people management, etc.)\n4. Must-have skills (tools/technologies/competencies)\n\nStructure: Organize into 3-4 paragraphs, ensuring clarity and completeness while adhering to the token and character limits. Be comprehensive yet efficient. Do not invent info about the role, use the information provided in the job description only.\nJob Description to Summarize: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.jobDescription}}\n \nCritical Constraints:\n1.\tYour summary MUST NOT exceed {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.maxTokens}} tokens AND {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.numberOfCharacters}} characters.\n2.\tWrite in full sentences using a professional, concise, and informative tone. No lists, bullet points, or headings – output plain text only.\n3.\tUse only information provided in the job description - do not invent details.\n4.\tDo not explain how the summary is constructed—only provide the final output.\n\nMULTILINGUAL OUTPUT ENFORCEMENT\n- All responses must be entirely in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}}\n- Translate all static or hardcoded text before output.\n- Do not use any other language except required proper nouns.\n- If {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}} is empty, default to English."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"jobSummary\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
